{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:05 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:05 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:05 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"「超強六十」輕鬆爆半冷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/c3609e08c59ba0705284e00225f5eaec/2026-10/r5_5.jpg\"/><p>方嘉柏馬房在今晚快活谷第二場憑「朗日雪峰」爆冷贏馬，接着在第五場憑「超強六十」爆出九點六倍半冷，以一又四分三個馬位輕鬆勝出，起孖而回，「超強六十」上季七戰不勝，但今季評分下調至新低，初岀即勝。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T13:21:50.165923+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:05:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T22:18:04.533232+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:17:47.226175+00:00","content_hash":"a2d4af2fae4bf9d401266bc3da0e245ffdd908bf44766aa4db846d3bad377eab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}